AudioReach / TDM / CS35L41 / sc8280xp sound support, from the squashed
liuqin downstream patch.

Adjustments for v7.2.5:
- sound/soc/codecs/wm_adsp.c: both hunks dropped - v7.2.5 upstream
  reworked wm_adsp_request_firmware_files() to support component
  prefixes/suffixes for DT systems natively.
- sound/soc/qcom/qdsp6/q6apm.c: dropped - v7.2.5 already propagates
  audioreach_set_media_format() errors.
- sound/soc/qcom/qdsp6/audioreach.h: re-added MODULE_ID_TDM_SINK /
  MODULE_ID_AUDIO_IF_{SINK,SOURCE} at their v7.2.5 positions.
- sound/soc/qcom/qdsp6/q6apm-dai.c: rewritten onto the v7.2.5 code -
  ack() guard on Q6APM_STREAM_RUNNING and trigger() state set kept;
  prepare() return-value fix already upstream.
- sound/soc/qcom/sc8280xp.c: rewritten onto v7.2.5, which already has
  sc8280xp_is_tdm_dai()/sc8280xp_tdm_hw_params(); added the
  sm8450-sndcard TERTIARY_TDM_RX_0 4ch/S24_LE fixup, TDM guards in
  startup/shutdown/hw_params/prepare/hw_free, sound/cs35l41.h include.
- drivers/firmware/cirrus/cs_dsp.c, sound/soc/codecs/cs35l41.*,
  wm_adsp.h, common.*, audioreach.c, q6apm-lpass-dais.c, topology.c,
  snd_ar_tokens.h: applied cleanly, no changes.

